WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.160
Start on Home: describe your goal to Aira or continue from My projects. First, we will save a Record.

2
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:18.080
Open your workspace from My projects, then choose Protocols.

3
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:25.440
Open an existing Protocol, read the instructions and check its version.

4
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:31.120
Choose Add Record to open its editable form.

5
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:38.600
Enter synthetic sample DEMO-START, count 12, and mark the note as demo data.

6
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:46.280
Choose Submit, then verify the destination project, Protocol and version.

7
00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:53.320
Confirm submission and open View saved Record to inspect the result.

8
00:00:53.320 --> 00:01:00.920
Reload the page. The saved values remain: your first Record is complete.

9
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:08.000
You can also write documents. Return to the project and choose Documents.

10
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:17.160
Choose New document and preview Meeting notes. This destination belongs to the project and follows its permissions.

11
00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:25.960
For an existing spreadsheet, open the matching Protocol’s Records and choose Bulk upload.

12
00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:34.800
Download this Protocol’s CSV template and match its fields. Validate before confirming the import.

13
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:46.320
For a new experiment, create a Protocol with Aira when AI is enabled, or start from a template. See the separate AI walkthrough.

14
00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:54.040
Return to Home and resume from My projects instead of finding the same workspace again.
